XSB db VDD Ibias VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
* bit 0: 1 units, S0 -> bias node (trim[0] = 1), S0X -> aux node (trim[0] = 0)
XM1 d0 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XS0 d0 trim[0] Ibias VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
XS0X d0 tb0 aux VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
XMIP0 tb0 trim[0] VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1.0u nf=1
XMIN0 tb0 trim[0] VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=0.5u nf=1
* bit 1: 2 units, S1 -> bias node (trim[1] = 1), S1X -> aux node (trim[1] = 0)
XM2_m0 d1 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM2_m1 d1 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
