XS1X d1 tb1 aux VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
XMIP1 tb1 trim[1] VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1.0u nf=1
XMIN1 tb1 trim[1] VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=0.5u nf=1
* bit 2: 4 units, S2 -> bias node (trim[2] = 1), S2X -> aux node (trim[2] = 0)
XM3_m0 d2 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM3_m1 d2 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM3_m2 d2 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM3_m3 d2 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XS2 d2 trim[2] Ibias VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
XS2X d2 tb2 aux VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
