* bit 3: 8 units, S3 -> bias node (trim[3] = 1), S3X -> aux node (trim[3] = 0)
XM4_m0 d3 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM4_m1 d3 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
