XM4_m3 d3 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM4_m4 d3 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM4_m5 d3 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM4_m6 d3 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XM4_m7 d3 Vgs VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=6.0u W=1.0u nf=1
XS3 d3 trim[3] Ibias VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
XS3X d3 tb3 aux VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
XMIP3 tb3 trim[3] VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1.0u nf=1
XMIN3 tb3 trim[3] VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=0.5u nf=1
* auxiliary node: M_Aux to VSS; analog control: cal = 1 -> MCAL makes M_Aux a diode (aux node at the
* bias node's voltage); cal = 0 -> MCAL off, MDIS discharges vaux (C_AUX): I_Aux -> 0
VAUX aux auxm 0
XMAUX auxm vaux VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=8.0u W=10.0u nf=1
XMCAL auxm cal vaux VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1.0u nf=1
XMDIS vaux calb VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=45.45u W=0.5u nf=1
XMCAUX VSS vaux VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=5.0u W=5.0u nf=1
XMIPC calb cal VDD VDD pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1.0u nf=1
XMINC calb cal VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=0.5u nf=1
.ends trim_steer
.include /foss/designs/engn2912e-ref/analog/neuron/layout/bias_cell_lvs_ref.spice
.subckt bias_generator VDD VSS trim[3] trim[2] trim[1] trim[0] cal Imon Vb Vlk VKdn VIp Vamp_bias VK VNA VKup Vthr VT_dpi VT_inh
Xmaster VDD VSS Iref bias_master
Xtrim VDD VSS Iref Ibias_s trim[3] trim[2] trim[1] trim[0] cal trim_steer
VIB Ibias_s Ibias 0
Xcell VDD VSS Ibias Vb Vlk VKdn VIp Vamp_bias VK VNA VKup Vthr VT_dpi VT_inh bias_cell
* Imon: copy of bias_cell's input diode MN0 (W10/L8), sinks a copy of Ibias from the Imon pad
XMMON Imon Ibias VSS VSS nfet_03v3 L=8.0u W=10.0u nf=1
.ends bias_generator
